{* The activity indicator over the whole page while it waits on the server, on every page and shown
	by javascript/busy.js. Here rather than built by the script, so it is drawn from what the page
	already has the moment it is needed. *}
<div id="ad-busy" popover="manual" role="progressbar" aria-label="{t('busy.loading')}">{include 'icons/spinner.latte'}</div>
